# Rendered by the template channel ({{ template_source_label }}, project kind);
# the gate keeps it matching its render. Edit the source and
# run `{{ runner_prog }} template.apply`; an edit here is drift.
# Every change appends to a plan note's decision record, so two
# changes in flight land at the same tail. A union merge takes both
# sides' lines there instead of stopping the integrate on a conflict;
# two edits of one existing line land both lines too, so a merged
# note is read once before it ships.
notes/*.md merge=union
notes/**/*.md merge=union
